  // place under the snow (same strength, same six-way treasure plus the Toy Sled); the Corrupt, Crimson and Hallowed
  // Mimics are far tougher and drop one of their biome's set plus Greater Healing Potions. The Mimic's own six-way
  // treasure is mimic_treasure in data/enemies/bestiary.json; the items are data/items/mimic_loot.json.
